    "summary": "A view of a traditional Batak Toba house decorated with gorga carvings in Lumban Lontung, Pangururan, Samosir Regency, North Sumatra, Indonesia. The structure features the distinctive Batak architectural style, including a sharply pitched roof, carved gorga motifs, and a raised wooden foundation. The photograph was taken during daylight with a clear sky and an open village courtyard.",
